  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters at rank five peak stage of one historical defense line share a defensive killer move called turtle house, formed by combining their strength. Relying on that move, they can defend against three attacks from a Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        568
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dazzling star armor is sold as a defensive killer move: once used, full body armor forms and shines like starlight.",
      "chapters": [
        667
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trade-listing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hair armor is a common defensive killer move in the five regions chaotic war memory. It uses rank five Indestructible Steel Mane Gu as its core with several hundred assisting Gu, growing hair into body armor that is cheap, efficient, and easy to replenish when damaged. Plump Lady judges it stronger than her martial sand armor and worth about two and a half immortal essence stones in treasure yellow heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        675
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hair-armor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_indestructible_steel_mane_gu",
        "char_plump_lady"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It remains only a mortal killer move, and Dark Arrow can pierce it in one hit.",
      "chapters": [
        677
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hair-armor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dark_arrow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hair armor covers the whole body without gaps. Kong Sheng Tian cannot be used together with it; choosing one blocks the other.",
      "chapters": [
        679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "conflict-with-movement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_kong_sheng_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Killer moves as Gu combinations in general are covered on killer moves. Offensive forms are covered on Offensive Killer Move. Healing forms are covered on Healing Killer Move. Movement forms are covered on Movement Killer Move.",
